[{"id":19,"url":"08408f10-eefa-49db-b0eb-db74afaaa19e","subject":"Th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i (I am doing \/ I do) v\u1edbi \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai","content":[{"contentHtml":"<p><strong>A.<\/strong> <strong>Th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n v\u1edbi \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai.<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u v\u00ed d\u1ee5 sau:<\/p><ul><li>This is Tom's schedule for next week. (\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 th\u1eddi kh\u00f3a bi\u1ec3u c\u1ee7a Tom cho tu\u1ea7n sau)<\/li><li>He <strong>is playing<\/strong> tennis on Monday afternoon. (Anh \u1ea5y s\u1ebd ch\u01a1i tennis v\u00e0o bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u th\u1ee9 hai)<\/li><li>He <strong>is going<\/strong> to the dentist on Tuesday morning. (Anh \u1ea5y s\u1ebd \u0111i t\u1edbi nha s\u0129 v\u00e0o s\u00e1ng th\u1ee9 ba)<\/li><li>He <strong>is having<\/strong> dinner with Ann on Friday. (Anh \u1ea5y s\u1ebd d\u00f9ng b\u1eefa t\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Ann v\u00e0o th\u1ee9 s\u00e1u)<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Trong c\u00e1c v\u00ed d\u1ee5 \u1edf tr\u00ean, Tom \u0111\u00e3 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng th\u1ee9 tr\u00ean.<\/p><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Khi ta n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng g\u00ec m\u00e0 ta<strong> d\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m<\/strong>, th\u00ec ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n (I am doing). Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00f9ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n.<\/p><ul><li>\" What <strong>are <\/strong>you <strong>doing <\/strong>tomorrow evening? \" \" <strong>I'm going<\/strong> to the theater. \"<\/li><li>\" <strong>Are <\/strong>you <strong>playing <\/strong>tennis tomorrow? \" \" Yes, but Tom<strong> isn't playing<\/strong>. He hurt his leg. \"<\/li><li>\" Ann <strong>is coming <\/strong>tomorrow. \" \"Oh, is she? What time <strong>is <\/strong>she <strong>arriving<\/strong>? \" \" At 10:15. \" \" <strong>Are <\/strong>you <strong>meeting <\/strong>her at the station? \" \" I can't. I'<strong>m working <\/strong>tomorrow morning. \"<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>+)<\/strong> C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac going to (do) . v\u00ed d\u1ee5 :<\/p><ul><li>What <strong>are <\/strong>you <strong>going to do <\/strong>tomorrow evening?<\/li><li>Tom <strong>is going to play <\/strong>tennis on Monday afternoon.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong>will <\/strong>\u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng vi\u1ec7c m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>B. Th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n v\u1edbi ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai<\/strong>.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n khi ta n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 <strong>th\u1eddi kh\u00f3a bi\u1ec3u, l\u1ecbch tr\u00ecnh<\/strong>, ... (v\u00ed d\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 l\u1ecbch tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n giao th\u00f4ng, l\u1ecbch chi\u1ebfu phim):<\/p><ul><li>What time <strong>does <\/strong>the movies <strong>begin<\/strong>?<\/li><li>The train <strong>leaves <\/strong>Da Nang at 7:25 a.m. and <strong>arrives <\/strong>in Ha Noi at 8 p.m.<\/li><li>The football game <strong>starts <\/strong>at 2:00.<\/li><li>Tomorrow <strong>is <\/strong>Wednesday.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>+)<\/strong> Nh\u01b0ng ta kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n cho nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 vi\u1ec7c s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp c\u1ee7a c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n. Ch\u00fang ta d\u00f9ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n.<\/p>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"A."},{"insert":" "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"Th\u00ec hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n v\u1edbi \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng 